## Findings
- Found two blue arrow buttons on the right side.
- Overseas button (해외구매대행) at approx (961, 227).
- Domestic button (국내위탁판매) at approx (961, 429).
- Clicking either button triggers a Windly popup with class `sesame-floating-close`.
- The popup in my test said "Plan Expired".
- The buttons themselves appear as empty `<button>` tags in the simplified DOM tree, possibly due to Shadow DOM or missing attributes in the tool's view.
- The text "해외구매대행" and "국내위탁판매" are separate nodes, not inside the buttons.
- The issue might be:
  1. Bot clicks the wrong button (Overseas instead of Domestic).
  2. Bot clicks the text instead of the button.
  3. The buttons are not reliably detected when the page scrolls.
  4. The bot's selector for the button is too generic.
